    "@value" : "A \"vaem:CurationGraph\" is a graph to hold metadata that is needed to describe, govern and provision another graph. A curation graph will likely use VOAG and VAEM for this purpose. The property \"vaem:curationGraph\" is used to link to the graph (or graphs) being curated"
