    "@value" : "Either one of a disease or an individual phenotypic feature. Some knowledge resources such as Monarch treat these as distinct, others such as MESH conflate.  Please see definitions of phenotypic feature and disease in this model for their independent descriptions.  This class is helpful to enforce domains and ranges that may involve either a disease or a phenotypic feature."
  } ],
